        {
          "title": "Encoding + scaling",
          "markdown": [
            "<h3>A.4 Encoding + scaling + (outliers: visualization only) + feature selection</h3>\n<p>Since this is <strong>clustering</strong> (no target), feature selection is mostly driven by:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Domain approach</strong>: distance + cost + volume + address</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Filter</strong>: correlations (avoid redundant variables)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Embedded (unsupervised)</strong>: PCA/SVD to visualize and sanity-check separability</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We prepare a numerical matrix by:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>imputing missing values</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>standardizing</strong> numerical features</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>one-hot encoding</strong> <code>governorate</code> and <code>city</code> (with rare-city grouping).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Outliers are shown via boxplots (section A.2), without clipping/removal.</p>\n</blockquote>"
